        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Xingcheng, Linzhou, Liaoning province, Henan, Liaodong Bay, Bohai Sea, Huludao, China\n- Organizations: Liaoning Finance and Trade College, Shenyang Shifan University Bohai College\n- Topics: population, area, location, former names\n\nFacts:\n- Xingcheng, formerly named Ningyuan, is a county-level city in southwest Liaoning province, China.\n- Xingcheng is located on Liaodong Bay on the northern coast of the Bohai Sea and has approximately 140,000 urban inhabitants.\n- Linzhou in Henan covers an area of 2,046 square kilometers and has a population of about one million.\n- Liaoning Finance and Trade College was formerly known as Shenyang Shifan University Bohai College.\n- Liaoning Finance and Trade College is a small private undergraduate college in Xingcheng, southwest of Huludao, on the Liaodong Bay coast in Liaoning province, China.\n- Liaoning Finance and Trade College is partially walled and is located on the Bohai coast on the east coast of China.",
